        "tree_id": "dd7ace71f5f178a5fa82aab6f06dabff640e3b7b",
        "message": "feat(PR-S2): immutable facts and deterministic propagation\n\npackages/world-state/ holds an append-only FactLog, FNV-1a derivation of\nfact ids and consequences, per-client reports and a t2Verdict that names\neach failed requirement. Client agreement compares {factIds, variantIds,\nepoch} — the client id is deliberately excluded.\n\nScript: 5 facts in window (+1 late excluded), 2 strata, 5 variant swaps,\n30 captures, two clients agree, verdict pass, deterministic.\n\nTwo test defects fixed: whole-report comparison counted the client id;\none verdict test used a single-stratum script instead of weakening T2.\n\nGDD-CONSEQUENCE 0.3 (I9), corrupted §18 table repaired. The blueprint acc\n'pnpm sim prs2 --assert' could never run (no sim script); repaired to the\nvitest command (thirteenth broken form). B2 required co: [qa-engineer] for\nthe append-only prototype report. 7 pnpm test --filter accs remain.\n\nAcceptance: test 8/8, full 154/154, verify 17/17, tracer green.\n\nAgent: gameplay-engineer\nTask: PR-S2",
